// AWS IAM Privileged/Admin Managed Policy Attached  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1098.003
// Detects attachment of an escalation-equivalent AWS managed policy (AdministratorAccess, IAMFullAccess, or PowerUserAccess) to a user, role,…
// False positives: Deliberate, reviewed granting of privileged access (should be rare).
// Source: rules/privilege-escalation/iam-attach-administrator-policy.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
(eventName in~ ("AttachUserPolicy", "AttachRolePolicy", "AttachGroupPolicy")) and eventSource =~ "iam.amazonaws.com" and (''requestParameters.policyArn'' contains "AdministratorAccess" or ''requestParameters.policyArn'' contains "IAMFullAccess" or ''requestParameters.policyArn'' contains "PowerUserAccess")
